Any sysadmin who puts a passwd file with real encrypted passwords in
~ftp/etc is, in my opinion, an idiot.  The passwd file in ~ftp/etc
is put there solely for the use of anonymous ftp users (typically
through the ls command).  It sounds, IMHO, that you don't really 
understand the mechanics of anonymous ftp.

