Topics discussed in CAF-News 03.03:

   1-2    about professor at the State University of New York gathering
               evidence of student cheating by seaching the students' email
               archives
   3-5    about restricting UseNet feeds to grade and high schools
   6-8    on the consequences of restricting feeds by Newsgroups headers
