"Alternative" does not denote equally validity. What it connotes to you
appears subjective and beyond the scope of accepted meaning. What
criteria define "respect?" What are reasonable means for assessing those
criteria? These are legitimate questions, and not to be decided a priori
by fiat or by passionate assertion. One can respect some laws/policies
